# Minimap: treesitter signature overview
Output minimap.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Type "cd sample-project && nvim http.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type ":DwightMinimap"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Sleep 2s

Type ":q"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type ":DwightMinimap ."
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Sleep 3s
